<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">plant</ansi>

Slip an item from your backpack into an NPC's possession
or a container without being noticed. The last word is
treated as the target -- everything before it is the item.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">plant <item> <target></ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Examples:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">plant iron dagger merchant</ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">plant potion chest</ansi>

Uses the same skill check as <ansi fg="command">steal</ansi>.
Being hidden improves your chances. Cannot be used on
other players.

Requires <ansi fg="skill">skullduggery</ansi> rank 2.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help steal</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help skullduggery</ansi>
